      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## HEAT INPUT → COOLANT RESPONSE · selected time range\nThe charts share a time axis. Compare actual CPU/GPU power with coolant temperature and, later, measured radiator-intake air. Flow and fan feedback help explain whether the system changed its cooling effort. Missing probe data is never treated as 0°C."
